      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{若}X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\text{，则}\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\sim N(0,1)\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}\\;\\;U=\\frac{\\xi-1}{0.2}\\sim N(0,1)\\,.\\\\&amp;\\text{而}\\;\\;P\\{|\\xi|&gt;1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-P\\{|\\xi|\\leq 1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-P\\{-1.5\\leq \\xi\\leq 1.5\\}\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{又}\\;\\;P\\{-1.5\\leq \\xi\\leq 1.5\\}\\,=\\,P\\{\\frac{-1.5-1}{0.2}\\leq \\frac{\\xi-1}{0.2}\\leq \\frac{1.5-1}{0.2}\\}\\,=\\,P\\{-12.5\\leq U\\leq 2.5\\}\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{而}P\\{-12.5\\leq U\\leq 2.5\\}\\,=\\,\\Phi(2.5)-\\Phi(-12.5)=\\Phi(2.5)+\\Phi(12.5)-1\\approx\\Phi(2.5)=0.9938\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}\\;\\;P\\{|\\xi|&gt;1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-P\\{|\\xi|\\leq 1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-0.9938=0.0062\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{若}X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\text{，则}\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\sim N(0,1)\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}\\;\\;U=\\frac{\\xi-1}{0.2}\\sim N(0,1)\\,.\\\\&amp;\\text{而}\\;\\;P\\{|\\xi|&gt;1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-P\\{|\\xi|\\leq 1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-P\\{-1.5\\leq \\xi\\leq 1.5\\}\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{又}\\;\\;P\\{-1.5\\leq \\xi\\leq 1.5\\}\\,=\\,P\\{\\frac{-1.5-1}{0.2}\\leq \\frac{\\xi-1}{0.2}\\leq \\frac{1.5-1}{0.2}\\}\\,=\\,P\\{-12.5\\leq U\\leq 2.5\\}\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{而}P\\{-12.5\\leq U\\leq 2.5\\}\\,=\\,\\Phi(2.5)-\\Phi(-12.5)=\\Phi(2.5)+\\Phi(12.5)-1\\approx\\Phi(2.5)=0.9938\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{所以}\\;\\;P\\{|\\xi|&gt;1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-P\\{|\\xi|\\leq 1.5\\}\\,=\\,1-0.9938=0.0062\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
