          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"^ 3\">^ 3</span>"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "D",
      "answer_index": 3,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{由于 } P\\{X&gt;c\\}=1-P\\{X\\leq c\\}\\,, \\text{故} \\\\ &amp; \\qquad\\qquad1-P\\{X\\leq C\\}=P\\{X\\leq C\\}\\,, \\\\ &amp; \\text{得}\\quad P\\{X\\leq C\\}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,. \\\\ &amp; \\text{又}\\quad P\\{X\\leq C\\}=\\Phi(\\frac{c-3}{2})\\,, \\text{故} \\\\ &amp; \\qquad\\qquad\\Phi(\\frac{c-3}{2})=\\frac{1}{2}\\,, \\\\ &amp; \\text{得}\\quad\\frac{c-3}{2}=0,\\;c=3\\,. \\\\ &amp; \\text{速记：若 } X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\,, \\text{则 } P\\{X&lt;\\mu\\}=P\\{X&gt;\\mu\\}\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{由于 } P\\{X&gt;c\\}=1-P\\{X\\leq c\\}\\,, \\text{故} \\\\ &amp; \\qquad\\qquad1-P\\{X\\leq C\\}=P\\{X\\leq C\\}\\,, \\\\ &amp; \\text{得}\\quad P\\{X\\leq C\\}=\\frac{1}{2}\\,. \\\\ &amp; \\text{又}\\quad P\\{X\\leq C\\}=\\Phi(\\frac{c-3}{2})\\,, \\text{故} \\\\ &amp; \\qquad\\qquad\\Phi(\\frac{c-3}{2})=\\frac{1}{2}\\,, \\\\ &amp; \\text{得}\\quad\\frac{c-3}{2}=0,\\;c=3\\,. \\\\ &amp; \\text{速记：若 } X\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2)\\,, \\text{则 } P\\{X&lt;\\mu\\}=P\\{X&gt;\\mu\\}\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
