          "label": "D",
          "html": "<span class=\"math-tex math-inline\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}p_2 = P\\{Y \\geq \\mu + 5\\} = 1 - \\Phi(0)\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}p_2 = P\\{Y \\geq \\mu + 5\\} = 1 - \\Phi(0)\\end{aligned}</span>"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "answer_index": 2,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由}X\\sim N(\\mu,4^{\\prime})\\text{知},\\ \\frac{X-\\mu}{4}\\sim N(0,1),\\ \\text{同理},\\ \\frac{Y-\\mu}{5}\\sim N(0,1)\\,.\\\\&amp;\\quad p_{1}=P\\{X\\leq\\mu-4\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{4}\\leq-1\\right\\}=\\Phi(-1)=1-\\Phi(1)\\,,\\\\&amp;\\quad p_{2}=P\\{Y\\geq\\mu+5\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{Y-\\mu}{5}\\geq 1\\right\\}=1-\\Phi(1)\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{故对任意实数}\\mu,\\ \\text{均有}\\ p_{1}=p_{2}\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\text{由}X\\sim N(\\mu,4^{\\prime})\\text{知},\\ \\frac{X-\\mu}{4}\\sim N(0,1),\\ \\text{同理},\\ \\frac{Y-\\mu}{5}\\sim N(0,1)\\,.\\\\&amp;\\quad p_{1}=P\\{X\\leq\\mu-4\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{4}\\leq-1\\right\\}=\\Phi(-1)=1-\\Phi(1)\\,,\\\\&amp;\\quad p_{2}=P\\{Y\\geq\\mu+5\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{Y-\\mu}{5}\\geq 1\\right\\}=1-\\Phi(1)\\,,\\\\&amp;\\text{故对任意实数}\\mu,\\ \\text{均有}\\ p_{1}=p_{2}\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
