      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} \\text{若}\\ \\xi\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2),\\ \\text{则}\\ \\frac{\\xi-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\sim N(0,1)\\,.\\ \\text{故}\\\\ P\\{\\mu&lt;X&lt;2\\mu\\}&amp;=P\\left\\{\\frac{\\mu-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{2\\mu-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\\\\ &amp;=P\\left\\{0&lt;\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\\\\ &amp;=\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})-\\Phi(0)=\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})-0.5\\,.\\end{aligned} \\text{又}0.3=P\\{\\mu&lt;X&lt;2\\mu\\}=\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})-0.5\\,，\\text{于是}\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})=0.8\\,．\\text{所以} \\begin{aligned} P\\{X&lt;0\\}&amp;=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{0-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;-\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\\\\ &amp;=\\Phi(-\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})=1-\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})=1-0.8=0.2\\,.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} \\text{若}\\ \\xi\\sim N(\\mu,\\sigma^2),\\ \\text{则}\\ \\frac{\\xi-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\sim N(0,1)\\,.\\ \\text{故}\\\\ P\\{\\mu&lt;X&lt;2\\mu\\}&amp;=P\\left\\{\\frac{\\mu-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{2\\mu-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\\\\ &amp;=P\\left\\{0&lt;\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\\\\ &amp;=\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})-\\Phi(0)=\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})-0.5\\,.\\end{aligned} \\text{又}0.3=P\\{\\mu&lt;X&lt;2\\mu\\}=\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})-0.5\\,，\\text{于是}\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})=0.8\\,．\\text{所以} \\begin{aligned} P\\{X&lt;0\\}&amp;=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;\\frac{0-\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-\\mu}{\\sigma}&lt;-\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma}\\right\\}\\\\ &amp;=\\Phi(-\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})=1-\\Phi(\\frac{\\mu}{\\sigma})=1-0.8=0.2\\,.\\end{aligned}</div>"
