      "answer": "A",
      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{先求任意误差的绝对值超过19.6的概率}p\\\\ &amp; \\quad P=\\mathop{P}\\{\\left|X\\right|&gt;19.6\\} = 1-\\mathop{P}\\{\\left|X\\right|\\leq 19.6\\} \\\\ &amp; \\quad = 1-\\mathop{P}\\left\\{\\left|\\frac{X}{10}\\right|\\leq 1.96\\right\\} = 1-\\left[\\Phi(1.96)-\\Phi(-1.96)\\right]\\\\ &amp; \\quad = 1-[2\\Phi(1.96)-1] = 1-[2\\times 0.975-1] = 1-0.95=0.05. \\\\ &amp; \\text{设}Y\\text{为}100\\text{次测量中误差绝对值超过}19.6\\text{的次数}，\\text{则}Y\\sim b(100,0.05). \\\\ &amp; \\text{因为}n\\text{很大},p\\text{很小，可用泊松分布近似，}np=5=\\lambda,\\text{所以}\\\\ &amp; \\quad P\\{Y\\geq 3\\}\\approx 1-\\frac{5^0e^{-5}}{0!}-\\frac{5^1e^{-5}}{1!}-\\frac{5^2e^{-5}}{2!}=1-\\frac{37}{2}^{-5}\\approx 0.87.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned} &amp; \\text{先求任意误差的绝对值超过19.6的概率}p\\\\ &amp; \\quad P=\\mathop{P}\\{\\left|X\\right|&gt;19.6\\} = 1-\\mathop{P}\\{\\left|X\\right|\\leq 19.6\\} \\\\ &amp; \\quad = 1-\\mathop{P}\\left\\{\\left|\\frac{X}{10}\\right|\\leq 1.96\\right\\} = 1-\\left[\\Phi(1.96)-\\Phi(-1.96)\\right]\\\\ &amp; \\quad = 1-[2\\Phi(1.96)-1] = 1-[2\\times 0.975-1] = 1-0.95=0.05. \\\\ &amp; \\text{设}Y\\text{为}100\\text{次测量中误差绝对值超过}19.6\\text{的次数}，\\text{则}Y\\sim b(100,0.05). \\\\ &amp; \\text{因为}n\\text{很大},p\\text{很小，可用泊松分布近似，}np=5=\\lambda,\\text{所以}\\\\ &amp; \\quad P\\{Y\\geq 3\\}\\approx 1-\\frac{5^0e^{-5}}{0!}-\\frac{5^1e^{-5}}{1!}-\\frac{5^2e^{-5}}{2!}=1-\\frac{37}{2}^{-5}\\approx 0.87.\\end{aligned}</div>"
