      "answer_index": 0,
      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}F(5)=&amp;\\,P\\{X\\leq 5\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-1}{2}\\leq \\frac{5-1}{2}\\right\\}=\\Phi\\left(\\frac{5-1}{2}\\right)=\\Phi(2)\\;=\\;0.9772;\\\\P\\{0&lt;X\\leq 1.6\\}=&amp;\\Phi\\left(\\frac{1.6-1}{2}\\right)-\\Phi\\left(\\frac{0-1}{2}\\right)=\\Phi(0.3)-\\Phi(-0.5)\\\\=&amp;\\;0.6179-[1-\\Phi(0.5)]=0.6179-(1-0.6915)=0.3094;\\\\P\\{\\left|X-1\\right|\\leq 2\\}=&amp;P\\{-1\\leq X\\leq 3\\}=P\\left\\{-1\\leq \\frac{X-1}{2}\\leq 1\\right\\}\\\\=&amp;\\Phi(1)-\\Phi(-1)=2\\Phi(1)-1=2\\times 0.8413-1=0.6826.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}F(5)=&amp;\\,P\\{X\\leq 5\\}=P\\left\\{\\frac{X-1}{2}\\leq \\frac{5-1}{2}\\right\\}=\\Phi\\left(\\frac{5-1}{2}\\right)=\\Phi(2)\\;=\\;0.9772;\\\\P\\{0&lt;X\\leq 1.6\\}=&amp;\\Phi\\left(\\frac{1.6-1}{2}\\right)-\\Phi\\left(\\frac{0-1}{2}\\right)=\\Phi(0.3)-\\Phi(-0.5)\\\\=&amp;\\;0.6179-[1-\\Phi(0.5)]=0.6179-(1-0.6915)=0.3094;\\\\P\\{\\left|X-1\\right|\\leq 2\\}=&amp;P\\{-1\\leq X\\leq 3\\}=P\\left\\{-1\\leq \\frac{X-1}{2}\\leq 1\\right\\}\\\\=&amp;\\Phi(1)-\\Phi(-1)=2\\Phi(1)-1=2\\times 0.8413-1=0.6826.\\end{aligned}</div>"
